{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30398","headline":"抒怀上歙州卢中丞宣州杜侍郎 · 赵嘏","name":"抒怀上歙州卢中丞宣州杜侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东来珠履与旌旗，前者登朝亦一时。\n竹马迎呼逢稚子，柏台长告见男儿。\n花飘舞袖楼相倚，角送归轩客尽随。\n独有贱夫怀感激，十年两地负恩知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}